## ALiF — Legacy & Background

### BUSINESS HISTORY

ALiF has a long history in tailoring and retail, with roots going back to the year 2000.

- Before operating as ALiF, the business was known as "GK Store".
- GK Store originally operated in Kahalgaon, Bihar, starting around 2000.
- ALiF first opened in Sahibganj in 2008.
- The first Sahibganj location was near/opposite College Road.
- ALiF operated for more than a decade at Rajender Market, located opposite the college.
- The Rajender Market location was demolished in 2024, after which ALiF moved from that location.
- During its history at the College Road location, the business also operated under another name.
- After leaving the previous College Road/Rajender Market location, ALiF established its current location at Daal Kuan, College Road, Sahibganj.

### EXPERIENCE

- ALiF has more than a decade of experience in tailoring.
- ALiF has experienced tailors who handle different types of tailoring and stitching work.

### BRAND BACKGROUND

ALiF's current business is built on a long-standing tailoring background and experience dating back to 2000, including its earlier identity as GK Store and its operations in Kahalgaon and Sahibganj.

